                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Oh... the concern is this?\n\n```json\n    \"Exposes\": [\n        {\n            \"Address\": \"$address\",\n            \"Bus\": \"$bus\",\n            \"Name\": \"Ventura RMC LED Board $bus\",\n            \"Type\": \"Board\"\n        }\n    ],\n```\n\nI don't know what that's doing.  It probably isn't needed."
